{
 "title": "Rocket City",
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "Rocket City",
   "card": false,
   "beats": [
    {
     "id": "c447",
     "shot": "rc_arsenal",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "1941.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c448",
     "shot": "rc_arsenal",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "War again.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c449",
     "shot": "rc_arsenal",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "The Army builds a giant weapons plant next",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c450",
     "shot": "rc_arsenal",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "to a quiet cotton town in the north",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c451",
     "shot": "rc_arsenal",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "called Huntsville.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ding",
       "w:Huntsville.",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c452",
     "shot": "rc_arsenal",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Its name is Redstone Arsenal.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c453",
     "shot": "rc_arsenal",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "When the war ends, the arsenal goes quiet.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c454",
     "shot": "rc_arsenal",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Huntsville is about to lose its biggest employer.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c455",
     "shot": "rc_germans",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "And then, in 1950, the Army sends over",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "whoosh",
       "w:1950,",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c456",
     "shot": "rc_germans",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "a hundred German engineers to Huntsville.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c457",
     "shot": "rc_germans",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Huntsville at the time had about 16,000",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c458",
     "shot": "rc_germans",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "people, and proudly called itself the watercress capital",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c459",
     "shot": "rc_germans",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "of the world.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c460",
     "shot": "rc_germans",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "And these strangers had come to build rockets.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "rumble",
       "w:rockets.",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c461",
     "shot": "rc_germans",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Their leader was Wernher von Braun.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c462",
     "shot": "rc_germans",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "In Germany, he had built the V-2,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c463",
     "shot": "rc_germans",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "the world's first long-range ballistic missile.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c464",
     "shot": "rc_past",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "That is the part of the story Huntsville",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c465",
     "shot": "rc_past",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "took years to face.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c466",
     "shot": "rc_past",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Von Braun had been a member of the",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c467",
     "shot": "rc_past",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Nazi party and an officer in the SS.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c468",
     "shot": "rc_past",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "His V-2 rockets were built underground by",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c469",
     "shot": "rc_past",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "prisoners from a concentration camp.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c470",
     "shot": "rc_past",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Thousands of those prisoners died.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c471",
     "shot": "rc_past",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "More people died building the V-2 than",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c472",
     "shot": "rc_past",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "were killed by it.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c473",
     "shot": "rc_past",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "After the war, the United States wanted his",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c474",
     "shot": "rc_past",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "knowledge more than it wanted answers.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c475",
     "shot": "rc_past",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Questions about his past came much later.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c476",
     "shot": "rc_explorer",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "In Huntsville, the team got to work.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c477",
     "shot": "rc_explorer",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "January 1958.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c478",
     "shot": "rc_explorer",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "A rocket built by the Huntsville team launches",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "rumble",
       "w:launches",
       0.6
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c479",
     "shot": "rc_explorer",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Explorer 1, America's very first satellite.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "blip",
       "w:Explorer",
       0.6
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c480",
     "shot": "rc_saturn",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "1960.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c481",
     "shot": "rc_saturn",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "NASA opens the Marshall Space Flight Center at",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c482",
     "shot": "rc_saturn",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Redstone.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c483",
     "shot": "rc_saturn",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Von Braun is its first director, and they",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c484",
     "shot": "rc_saturn",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "start drawing the biggest rocket the world had",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "slide_down",
       "w:drawing",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c485",
     "shot": "rc_saturn",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "ever seen, the Saturn V, taller than the",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c486",
     "shot": "rc_saturn",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Statue of Liberty, built to take people to",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c487",
     "shot": "rc_saturn",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "the moon.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c488",
     "shot": "rc_boom",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "The watercress town filled up with engineers, mathematicians,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c489",
     "shot": "rc_boom",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "and machinists.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c490",
     "shot": "rc_boom",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Within 10 years, Huntsville's population had more than",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c491",
     "shot": "rc_boom",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "quadrupled.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ticks",
       0,
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c492",
     "shot": "rc_boom",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "They called it the Rocket City.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ding",
       "w:Rocket",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c493",
     "shot": "rc_boom",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "But a few hours south in Montgomery, on",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c494",
     "shot": "rc_boom",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "our street, something else was about to launch.",
     "date": null
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}